direction: down
startup: Agent starts
meta: Read name + description only
task: Task arrives
match: Match task to descriptions
body: Load SKILL.md body
scripts: Run scripts/ if told
check: Exit criterion
done: Done
startup -> meta: every skill
task -> match
meta -> match
match -> body: description fits
body -> scripts: step says run
scripts -> check: output as evidence
body -> check
check -> done: pass
check -> body: fail, redo step
